{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the solution set to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd3f93505f31dc1aa31019b98b9f03a578ff5f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3x - 5} = |x - 5|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"23\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/c/f7cd0be20e69f0ee0923917452916a6c7d41a3ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\emptyset \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\{10\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\{3, 10\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\{-10\\} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\{-3, -10\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"537\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For this to be true, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/4/a44acdf4104573dff51ae15834f0d16037cff0b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x - 5 = (x - 5)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/b/d2b85d7727149e7a13f3abbeb8d3c9af2077c96d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x - 5 = x^{2} - 10x + 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"186\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/6/8e6bd9dbffd3644b6fc575c766c5c4fb45bdf574.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - 13x + 30 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b3edeb2790551ae2fbdfe72b474c51702f6b244.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 10)(x - 3) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This means that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce07f44aade9496a90bf9ffa973f2152fcee4d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging these back in, we see that both of these solutions work, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/d/27d02419f39833ee36b3fead781944b0b8a5f304.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\{3, 10\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"102\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki